        "quote": "  \"tool_policy\": {\n    \"mode\": \"none\",\n    \"allowed_tools\": []\n  },\n  \"session_policy\": {\n    \"reuse\": \"never\",\n    \"inherit_user_skills\": false,\n    \"inherit_user_mcp\": false\n  },"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "视觉分析任务预算配置",
        "reason": "支持上下文、输出 token 和修复尝试次数的配置上限。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/visual-analyst/1/manifest.json",
          "startLine": 27,
          "endLine": 30
        },
        "quote": "  \"budget\": {\n    \"max_context_tokens\": 96000,\n    \"max_output_tokens\": 24000,\n    \"max_repair_attempts\": 2"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "宿主通过什么机制向无工具的 visual-analyst 提供原始图像，并如何确认所选 profile 具备所需视觉能力？",
        "why": "清单禁止工具但没有描述图像载荷、模型能力协商、不支持视觉输入时的拒绝行为或 KnowledgeBatch 生成结果。",
        "nextStep": "检查角色输入封装、profile 能力发现和视觉任务集成测试，验证原图传递、能力不兼容时的失败处理及 KnowledgeBatch 引用生成。",
